{"product":{"id":6580889387073,"title":"ABBA CB07 Round LED Cabinet\/Puck Light - Multiple Finishes\/Color Temperatures","body_html":"\u003cdiv data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBody Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cast Brushed Aluminum\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePower: \u003c\/strong\u003e1.8W\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003eDC 12V COB\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e-(P.D. COB= Chip On Board, new technology for the LED light engine)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLight Color Temperature: \u003c\/strong\u003eWarm White 3000K or Cool White 5000K\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eFinish: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eWhite, Black, or Silver\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eSize:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e2.5″ (65mm) (Diameter) x .4″ (10mm) (Depth) x 2.35″ (60mm) (Cutout)\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eDimmable:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eYes\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eLumens: \u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e180 LM\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cb\u003eBeam Angle:\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/b\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e24.2°\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED round cabinet downlights\u003c\/strong\u003e are easy to install and don’t take up any space since these lights are mounted or recessed into the cupboard effortlessly. This \u003cstrong\u003e12V DC led downlight\u003c\/strong\u003e can be both \u003cstrong\u003esurface mounted and recessed mounted\u003c\/strong\u003e and is made up of \u003cstrong\u003ecast brushed aluminum\u003c\/strong\u003e with a beautiful white, black, or silver finish, making it look more attractive and durable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn integrated 1.8W DC 12V COB LED emits 3000K or 5000K temperature with 80 Lumens of warm white light. These energy-efficient lights are dimmable. The dimensions of the under cabinet light are 2.5″ (65mm) (Diameter) x .4″ (10mm) (Depth) x 2.35″ (60mm) (Cutout).\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"ABBA Lighting","product_type":"LED Cabinet Lights","created_at":"2021-08-02T10:28:53-07:00","handle":"abba-2w-round-led-cabinet-puck-light-multiple-finishes-color-temperatures","updated_at":"2026-10-11T14:10:05-07:00","published_at":"2021-08-02T10:33:14-07:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"global","tags":"Brand_ABBA-Lighting, CCT_3000K, CCT_5000K, Finish_Black, Finish_Silver, Finish_White, Lumens_180lm, Shape_Round, Type_LED Undercabinet Lights, Volts_12V, Watts_1.8W","variants":[{"id":39395344777281,"product_id":6580889387073,"title":"White \/ 3000K","price":"17.64","sku":"CB07-WH-30K","position":1,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"White","option2":"3000K","option3":null,"created_at":"2021-08-02T10:33:14-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-11T14:10:05-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":454,"image_id":31366758203457,"weight":1.0,"weight_unit":"lb","inventory_quantity":0,"old_inventory_quantity":0,"requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":39395344810049,"product_id":6580889387073,"title":"White \/ 5000K","price":"19.85","sku":"CB07-WH-50K","position":2,"inventory_policy":"deny","compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":null,"option1":"White","option2":"5000K","option3":null,"created_at":"2021-08-02T10:33:14-07:00","updated_at":"2026-10-11T14:10:05-07:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":454,"image_id":3136